{"reviewId": "3126459_7ZwdqrDvk", "review": {"abstract": "(1)康波的繁荣期百分之百价格平稳；(2)康波的回升期三次中有两次价格平稳；(3)康波的衰退期价格百分之百剧烈波动；(4)康波的萧条期百分之百冲高回落", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "康波的成因在于创新说、货币说、世界体系说和原材料能源供给说，而且前四次康波的周期跨度分布在40-60年之间。第五次康波如果顶点从1983年起算，至今已经40年，按周期应该要进入萧条期，伴随AI创新的回升期还需要时日。全球化本质是一种世界体系，而今该体系面临百年未有之大变局，也会延缓回升期的到来，下一波应该源自中国工程师红利和印度与东南亚劳动力红利，需要抓牢这两个外部区域布局。而且债务阴影下的货币大宽松时代，也会延缓康波回升期价格平稳的特征到来。另外，康波的视角少了一个达利欧的债务，需要融合分析", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "12271-12346", "createTime": 1745029138, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "3126459_7ZwdqrDvk", "userVid": 3126459, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1745029382, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 3126459, "name": "firstprinciple", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/XYrRG5UShDd1OS4NmWmYVvGiahSoB8vicj5rBuDzEmgHdlDvOsl7jtCScOZuryFyyUSvvBSiaqaEak/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "firstprinciple", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 65, "likes": [{"userVid": 334632518, "name": "拽拽de偶（悟）", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJibwbEI8ocyqCGLHPpWBQdFYIdg78JWNqCL8WBibQCxQWunib2gceL901mYbwRs7j3WoEdzSicSGnDpA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": []